I used GENERATED ALWAYS AS IDENTITY for auto-increment primary keys .


DATE type for birth/hire/enrollment dates; VARCHAR for names and departments .


CHECK (credits > 0) ensures courses have positive credit values .


UNIQUE (student_id, course_id, semester, year) prevents double-enrolling the same student in the same course for the same term .


ON DELETE CASCADE on FKs: if you delete a student or course, their enrollments will be removed — useful for test data; change to RESTRICT if you prefer not to cascade deletes .
